    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview ------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/5499ecb1efadf87869132c9703247674.poster.avif?t=1749216550\" width=722 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/5499ecb1efadf87869132c9703247674.webm?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/5499ecb1efadf87869132c9703247674.mp4?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckland is a single-player game that combines deck building, Yutnori-like mechanics, and roguelite features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You become a sorcerer and travel back to ancient Korea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through battles, you can farm items and talismans, combining various talismans to protect the world from destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features ------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/d7c50f70badb79bf657e6664ce4e0444.poster.avif?t=1749216550\" width=578 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/d7c50f70badb79bf657e6664ce4e0444.webm?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/d7c50f70badb79bf657e6664ce4e0444.mp4?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Synthesis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The card synthesis system allows you to combine cards to execute combo chains. For example: Plum Blossom Sword Technique -&gt; Short-distance Technique -&gt; Shielding Technique -&gt; (Summon) Fire Slash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports your limitless creative play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/7c7c9e016130ab8de5a972e7dfa95604.poster.avif?t=1749216550\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/7c7c9e016130ab8de5a972e7dfa95604.webm?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/7c7c9e016130ab8de5a972e7dfa95604.mp4?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world filled with stories and fairy tales passed down through the ages. Your decisions will change the items you obtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike typical games, in Deckland, if the player reaches a near-death state, all cards will be reset, and you will acquire new cards to use. Discover a stronger version of yourself and don\u2019t fear death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/dbf89bcb97a004bbf7c297850e1fad7a.poster.avif?t=1749216550\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/dbf89bcb97a004bbf7c297850e1fad7a.webm?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/dbf89bcb97a004bbf7c297850e1fad7a.mp4?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player awakens to a voice. Release, who claims to be the strongest sorcerer, exhausts all his energy fighting a monster. However, he barely survives in the form of a talisman and asks the player to embark on an adventure together. What conclusion will unfold afterward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story features branching paths and animated cutscenes to enhance immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Souls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/57eafab751317dacb12ba40c726c88a7.poster.avif?t=1749216550\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/57eafab751317dacb12ba40c726c88a7.webm?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/57eafab751317dacb12ba40c726c88a7.mp4?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can utilize the souls of monsters to engage in more dynamic battles. Continue daring confrontations with cards obtained from defeated monsters and elite monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need any further assistance, feel free to ask!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview ------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/5499ecb1efadf87869132c9703247674.poster.avif?t=1749216550\" width=722 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/5499ecb1efadf87869132c9703247674.webm?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/5499ecb1efadf87869132c9703247674.mp4?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckland is a single-player game that combines deck building, Yutnori-like mechanics, and roguelite features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You become a sorcerer and travel back to ancient Korea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through battles, you can farm items and talismans, combining various talismans to protect the world from destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features ------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/d7c50f70badb79bf657e6664ce4e0444.poster.avif?t=1749216550\" width=578 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/d7c50f70badb79bf657e6664ce4e0444.webm?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/d7c50f70badb79bf657e6664ce4e0444.mp4?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Synthesis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The card synthesis system allows you to combine cards to execute