tem_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/dbf89bcb97a004bbf7c297850e1fad7a.mp4?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player awakens to a voice. Release, who claims to be the strongest sorcerer, exhausts all his energy fighting a monster. However, he barely survives in the form of a talisman and asks the player to embark on an adventure together. What conclusion will unfold afterward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story features branching paths and animated cutscenes to enhance immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Souls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/57eafab751317dacb12ba40c726c88a7.poster.avif?t=1749216550\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/57eafab751317dacb12ba40c726c88a7.webm?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991450/extras/57eafab751317dacb12ba40c726c88a7.mp4?t=1749216550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can utilize the souls of monsters to engage in more dynamic battles. Continue daring confrontations with cards obtained from defeated monsters and elite monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need any further assistance, feel free to ask!</p>",
